WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.200 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 3=

01:42.270 --> 01:43.509
I shall go raise the funds at once.

01:43.589 --> 01:44.309
But there is one request.

01:44.589 --> 01:46.309
I beg you, sir, do not make a commotion.

01:46.910 --> 01:48.030
My Lady

01:48.390 --> 01:49.470
is in talks of a marriage match.

01:49.910 --> 01:52.270
If anyone finds her alone in a room
with an unrelated man,

01:52.630 --> 01:54.470
her entire life will be ruined.

01:57.470 --> 01:59.429
It all depends on how quickly
you can get the money.

02:33.429 --> 02:34.790
Why hasn't the Ninth Young Lady
come out?

02:34.869 --> 02:36.149
The ladies are getting impatient.

02:36.709 --> 02:37.950
Exactly. What's taking so long?

02:50.469 --> 02:51.469
Relax.

02:52.070 --> 02:53.149
I'm after money,

02:53.749 --> 02:54.629
not blood.

02:55.309 --> 02:56.950
And I'm not about
to ruin your reputation.

03:17.070 --> 03:18.670
Mr. Zhao, you travel far and wide,

03:19.350 --> 03:20.589
with plenty of followers.

03:21.510 --> 03:23.110
I know you'll keep your word.

03:23.749 --> 03:24.670
Followers?

03:30.510 --> 03:32.429
Very clever, Ninth Young Lady.

03:32.909 --> 03:34.749
You accused me of "swindling,"

03:35.589 --> 03:37.110
and now everyone's turning on me.

03:38.110 --> 03:40.390
Marriage is supposed
to be a happy thing.

03:40.589 --> 03:42.830
Your family is the one
chasing powerful connections,

03:42.950 --> 03:45.309
using your marriage as leverage

03:45.309 --> 03:46.909
and me as their chance to move up.

03:46.909 --> 03:48.950
How is any of that my fault?

03:56.189 --> 03:57.589
You lied your way into this house.

03:58.709 --> 03:59.909
You're hardly innocent.

03:59.909 --> 04:01.510
And if you finish me off,

04:02.869 --> 04:04.550
do you think that'll change your fate?

04:06.469 --> 04:08.230
You're taking revenge
on the wrong person.

04:09.029 --> 04:10.309
From the very beginning,

04:11.469 --> 04:13.270
I'm not the one who did this to you.

04:13.830 --> 04:15.950
You don't have the nerve
to stand up to your grandmother,

04:16.150 --> 04:17.509
so you take it out on me instead.

04:18.230 --> 04:19.429
Tell me.

04:22.269 --> 04:23.749
Isn't that just

04:24.869 --> 04:26.389
picking on the easy target?

04:30.949 --> 04:32.389
She's still not ready?

04:32.509 --> 04:34.309
The poetry gathering started ages ago.

04:34.629 --> 04:36.829
- Exactly.
- The Ninth Young Lady's still inside.

04:37.150 --> 04:38.350
Is she all right?

04:43.710 --> 04:44.389
Forgive me.

04:47.189 --> 04:48.110
Ninth Young Lady!

04:48.509 --> 04:50.069
- My Lady!
- Ninth Young Lady!

04:50.150 --> 04:52.309
You knew I wouldn't hurt you.

04:52.309 --> 04:53.350
My Lady!

04:53.350 --> 04:54.110
Ninth Young Lady!

04:55.389 --> 04:56.910
- My Lady!
- My Lady!

04:56.910 --> 04:57.990
Open the door, My Lady!

04:59.389 --> 05:00.189
- My Lady!
- My Lady!

05:00.189 --> 05:01.790
- My Lady!
- Are you all right, My Lady?

05:01.869 --> 05:02.910
My Lady!

05:04.710 --> 05:05.790
- My Lady!
- Are you all right, My Lady?

05:06.629 --> 05:07.269
I'm fine.

05:08.629 --> 05:10.030
I was having a nightmare.

05:11.629 --> 05:13.150
How inconsiderate
of the Ninth Young Lady

05:13.150 --> 05:14.470
to keep Madam Yu waiting.

05:14.470 --> 05:15.470
She's getting impatient.

05:20.389 --> 05:21.869
The Ninth Young Lady has arrived.

05:23.509 --> 05:24.150
There she is.

05:46.309 --> 05:47.590
I'm sorry I'm late.

05:47.869 --> 05:48.749
I hope

05:49.110 --> 05:50.389
you ladies will forgive me.

05:54.670 --> 05:55.990
I heard that these past two nights,

05:55.990 --> 05:57.749
you haven't been sleeping well,
Madam Yu.

05:57.949 --> 05:59.389
I thought it might be from excess heat.

05:59.829 --> 06:01.189
I read

06:01.629 --> 06:03.429
lotus pods picked
before the morning dew dries

06:03.429 --> 06:04.509
are especially good

06:04.509 --> 06:05.869
for clearing heat.

06:06.030 --> 06:07.389
So I picked some

06:07.590 --> 06:08.550
and made you congee.

06:15.110 --> 06:16.829
Please don't be upset with me, Madam.

06:17.110 --> 06:18.429
I got a little carried away

06:18.429 --> 06:20.189
and got my clothes dirty
picking lotus pods.

06:20.470 --> 06:21.990
I had to go back and change.

06:22.069 --> 06:23.230
That's why I'm late.

06:28.230 --> 06:28.790
Come here.

06:31.470 --> 06:33.470
You could've had someone else
do all that.

06:33.790 --> 06:35.230
You didn't need to go yourself.

06:36.509 --> 06:38.350
What if you'd cut your hand?

06:38.910 --> 06:40.350
I'd hate to see you hurt.

06:45.429 --> 06:46.030
Mr. Zhao.

06:46.230 --> 06:46.829
Where is she?

06:47.030 --> 06:48.189
I made her mad.

06:49.309 --> 06:50.470
She was ready to take me down with her.

06:50.910 --> 06:51.829
What about the money?

06:53.749 --> 06:54.949
We'll find another way.

06:57.949 --> 06:58.590
Let's go.

07:07.230 --> 07:08.590
The Ninth Young Lady is admirable,

07:08.990 --> 07:10.910
but she's not the woman I want.

07:11.509 --> 07:12.790
Please reconsider

07:14.470 --> 07:16.069
this marriage, Mother.

07:21.150 --> 07:23.069
I don't care who you want.

07:23.470 --> 07:24.829
My choice

07:26.749 --> 07:28.350
is the Ninth Young Lady.

07:31.710 --> 07:33.189
I'm doing this for the Yu family,

07:34.309 --> 07:35.670
and for you.

07:53.030 --> 07:54.550
You think a woman proves her worth

07:54.629 --> 07:56.110
by running the household

07:56.110 --> 07:57.269
and balancing the books?

07:58.030 --> 07:59.990
If I hadn't cultivated
the right connections at court,

08:00.389 --> 08:02.509
do you think your father's career
would've gone this smoothly?

08:02.509 --> 08:04.269
Now he has a bright future ahead of him.

08:05.150 --> 08:07.710
All I want is the same for you.

08:09.429 --> 08:10.389
Then let me ask you this, Mother.

08:13.269 --> 08:15.629
If you had to choose between my career

08:15.629 --> 08:16.590
and Father's,

08:17.350 --> 08:18.269
who would you choose?

08:19.869 --> 08:20.910
What are you getting at?

08:22.230 --> 08:23.869
Father intends to enter
the Grand Secretariat.

08:24.869 --> 08:26.389
He means to rise to the very top.

08:28.269 --> 08:30.150
But father and son cannot serve
at court together.

08:30.910 --> 08:32.509
If Father rises that high,

08:33.269 --> 08:35.190
I'll be sent away to avoid
any appearance of favoritism,

08:35.190 --> 08:36.789
and my talents will go to waste.

08:39.430 --> 08:40.110
Mother.

08:41.869 --> 08:42.789
You always say

08:42.950 --> 08:45.110
I owe everything I have
to being born a Yu.

08:45.789 --> 08:47.749
But after all these years of hard work,
I've learned

08:49.350 --> 08:50.909
that no matter how hard I try,

08:50.909 --> 08:52.549
being a Yu
is exactly what holds me back.

08:54.029 --> 08:57.110
That's why you must place first
in the imperial examination.

08:58.430 --> 09:00.869
No top scholar has ever been sent away
from the capital.

09:01.629 --> 09:03.310
You are my son.

09:04.230 --> 09:06.310
I will see you rise
to the highest office

09:06.310 --> 09:07.470
and leave your name in history.

09:07.470 --> 09:09.230
And what if I don't place first?

09:11.389 --> 09:13.310
If you fail,

09:13.669 --> 09:15.629
your son will try after you.

09:22.669 --> 09:24.190
Controlling my life isn't enough
for you?

09:24.389 --> 09:26.149
You want to control my son's too?

09:27.029 --> 09:28.669
Just like Old Madam Fu,

09:30.430 --> 09:31.470
scheming for her grandson's future

09:32.110 --> 09:33.869
and her granddaughter's marriage,

09:34.710 --> 09:35.909
stopping at nothing,

09:35.909 --> 09:37.869
even turning someone
into a living symbol of chastity!

09:39.230 --> 09:39.869
Mother,

09:41.350 --> 09:42.590
do you truly want us

09:44.669 --> 09:46.269
to marry into a family like that?

09:47.230 --> 09:48.669
She works herself to the bone

09:49.230 --> 09:50.310
for the honor of her family.

09:50.430 --> 09:51.749
Why should I look down on her?

09:52.070 --> 09:53.789
If she'd had one capable son,

09:53.990 --> 09:55.230
she wouldn't have to go to such lengths.

09:55.669 --> 09:56.789
When the men are useless

09:57.430 --> 09:58.669
and women have to
hold the family together,

09:58.789 --> 10:00.190
what a ridiculous state of affairs.

10:01.710 --> 10:03.830
I'll obey you in anything else.

10:04.149 --> 10:06.749
But this is my happiness
for the rest of my life.

10:06.749 --> 10:08.909
I will marry someone whom I truly love.

10:09.070 --> 10:11.430
I am the Yu family matriarch.

10:11.909 --> 10:13.389
Your marriage

10:13.869 --> 10:15.590
is mine to decide.

10:16.190 --> 10:18.110
Even if you hate me for it today,

10:18.470 --> 10:20.230
I will not give you your way.

10:29.149 --> 10:31.070
If I marry the Ninth Young Lady
of the Fu family,

10:31.990 --> 10:33.190
won't I have

10:35.389 --> 10:36.990
two women like her to deal with?

10:37.470 --> 10:40.230
And then who will really be
in charge of the Yu family,

10:42.029 --> 10:43.430
me or her?

10:48.149 --> 10:49.350
You're Zuo Junjie?

10:50.830 --> 10:51.629
I heard

10:51.909 --> 10:53.269
your sister has been confined

10:53.990 --> 10:55.110
and roughed up as well.

10:56.149 --> 10:57.350
Perhaps I can help

10:57.869 --> 10:59.110
the two of you.

11:05.549 --> 11:07.310
My Lady, something terrible
has happened.

11:07.430 --> 11:09.590
That wretched Zuo is spreading lies
about your virtue.

11:09.909 --> 11:12.430
Isn't Madam Zuo still kneeling
in punishment at the ancestral hall?

11:13.070 --> 11:14.070
Not her.

11:14.070 --> 11:15.070
Zuo Junjie.

11:29.590 --> 11:30.869
Ninth Young Lady, you are here.

11:31.789 --> 11:32.350
Tingyun.

11:33.110 --> 11:33.869
Here you are.

11:35.190 --> 11:36.310
Your family

11:36.990 --> 11:39.509
refuses to believe we secretly pledged
ourselves to each other.

11:40.350 --> 11:41.389
But you know

11:41.629 --> 11:43.629
exactly what happened between us,
don't you?

11:44.990 --> 11:46.629
What the heck are you talking about?

11:47.230 --> 11:47.909
Tingyun, you...

11:57.070 --> 11:57.629
This is

11:58.230 --> 12:00.230
the love token you gave me.

12:00.509 --> 12:01.509
That's a lie!

12:02.509 --> 12:03.830
Grandmother, I never did.

12:05.149 --> 12:05.909
Tingyun,

12:06.310 --> 12:08.590
these are your favorite colors
and patterns,

12:08.789 --> 12:10.149
and this is your usual needlework.

12:10.149 --> 12:10.789
How can you...

12:11.470 --> 12:12.190
How can you

12:12.190 --> 12:13.470
put on your clothes

12:13.470 --> 12:14.669
and act like it never happened?

12:14.830 --> 12:17.110
The whole town
knows about us now anyway.

12:17.230 --> 12:18.430
There's no use denying it.

12:18.789 --> 12:19.749
My lady

12:20.029 --> 12:21.590
has never met you in private.

12:22.710 --> 12:25.230
The young master of the Yu family
doesn't even want you.

12:25.749 --> 12:26.789
But I fell for you

12:27.310 --> 12:28.509
the moment I saw you.

12:29.350 --> 12:32.070
Besides, we've known each other
since childhood.

12:32.070 --> 12:32.990
We're made for each other.

12:33.470 --> 12:34.549
Exactly.

12:34.549 --> 12:36.149
What a perfect match.

12:38.389 --> 12:39.070
Old Madam,

12:39.549 --> 12:40.549
I don't care whether Tingyun

12:40.549 --> 12:42.590
is already discussing marriage
with the Yu family.

12:43.470 --> 12:45.669
If she'll agree to marry me,

12:46.110 --> 12:47.149
I'll forget

12:47.669 --> 12:48.669
everything that's happened before.

12:48.669 --> 12:49.350
Shut up!

12:49.749 --> 12:51.350
Who do you think you are
to spout lies here?

12:51.830 --> 12:53.350
Mother, have him thrown out at once.

12:53.509 --> 12:55.110
We've heard enough of his filth.

12:55.629 --> 12:56.269
Guards.

12:56.389 --> 12:57.149
Get him out.

12:57.629 --> 12:58.029
Wait.

12:58.029 --> 12:58.710
Hold on.

12:58.830 --> 12:59.950
Leave that here.

13:03.230 --> 13:04.710
Fine. Keep it.

13:05.749 --> 13:07.509
It's not like

13:08.070 --> 13:09.190
that's the only one I have.

13:11.269 --> 13:13.029
Everyone in Huaying knows by now.

13:13.230 --> 13:14.669
If this isn't settled,

13:14.909 --> 13:16.830
it won't just ruin the Ninth Young Lady.

13:16.830 --> 13:17.909
It'll bring down the entire Fu family.

13:18.749 --> 13:19.990
You couldn't silence everyone
even if you tried.

13:22.710 --> 13:23.470
Grandmother.

13:23.749 --> 13:25.350
All my personal jewelry and clothes

13:25.350 --> 13:26.789
are kept by Moxiang.

13:27.629 --> 13:28.629
Where is she?

13:29.749 --> 13:31.029
No one's seen her

13:31.029 --> 13:31.990
since breakfast.

13:31.990 --> 13:33.789
We should find her
and question her at once.

13:35.110 --> 13:36.629
Then I won't keep you any longer.

13:36.869 --> 13:38.590
I've made my proposal.

13:38.710 --> 13:40.269
I'll take my leave.

13:42.950 --> 13:45.070
You have truly disappointed me.

13:45.830 --> 13:46.710
Grandmother,

13:47.230 --> 13:49.629
I've always taken your teachings
to heart.

13:49.629 --> 13:50.909
I would never do anything

13:51.230 --> 13:52.509
so shameless

13:52.509 --> 13:53.749
or disgraceful to our family.

13:53.749 --> 13:56.029
I'm disappointed that you failed
to keep your servants in line.

13:56.990 --> 13:59.070
Go back to your room

13:59.590 --> 14:01.669
and see what else is missing.

14:02.629 --> 14:03.389
Go.

14:04.990 --> 14:05.950
Hurry!

14:07.149 --> 14:07.749
Yes.

14:16.669 --> 14:17.389
Miss Fan,

14:17.669 --> 14:19.269
the Ninth Young Lady has given you
quite a few things over the years.

14:19.470 --> 14:20.590
Let's check those as well.

14:22.029 --> 14:22.830
We would never

14:22.830 --> 14:23.710
give anything belonging
to the Ninth Young Lady

14:23.710 --> 14:24.830
to Zuo Junjie.

14:25.230 --> 14:27.110
Everyone in Huaying knows fortune
favors you.

14:28.029 --> 14:29.430
You'll get through this.

14:30.190 --> 14:31.869
Do you still have
that filigree gold hairpin?

14:32.590 --> 14:33.110
Well...

14:33.789 --> 14:35.590
What about the gold-brocade silk dress?

14:36.350 --> 14:38.110
That was two years ago.

14:38.710 --> 14:40.190
I honestly don't remember.

14:40.190 --> 14:40.830
And the Huizhou inkstick?

14:41.029 --> 14:42.869
It bears the Fu family seal.

14:42.869 --> 14:43.549
Do you still have it?

14:45.350 --> 14:46.749
Well? Say something.

14:47.549 --> 14:48.230
Miss Fan

14:48.230 --> 14:50.149
grew up with the Ninth Young Lady.

14:50.149 --> 14:51.909
She's received countless gifts
over the years.

14:52.070 --> 14:53.190
If you want them all back now,

14:53.190 --> 14:54.549
how are we supposed
to find every last one?

14:54.629 --> 14:56.110
We're not asking for them back.

14:56.110 --> 14:57.549
We need to know which ones are missing.

14:57.549 --> 14:57.909
You...

15:01.230 --> 15:02.070
Miss Fan,

15:02.310 --> 15:04.190
do you still have these things or not?

15:04.310 --> 15:05.110
Enough.

15:06.470 --> 15:07.909
Some of the fabrics,

15:08.389 --> 15:09.509
jewelry,

15:10.070 --> 15:11.269
and ornaments you gave me...

15:11.909 --> 15:13.830
I did pawn some of them.

15:14.310 --> 15:16.869
The Fu family hosts
so many social occasions.

15:17.269 --> 15:18.789
Some clothes and jewelry

15:19.110 --> 15:21.590
can't be worn twice
after they've been seen once.

15:29.869 --> 15:31.430
The things Zuo Junjie has

15:31.549 --> 15:32.909
were most likely bought from Moxiang

15:33.149 --> 15:34.350
after he paid her off.

15:34.749 --> 15:36.389
If he produces anything else tomorrow

15:36.389 --> 15:37.110
to frame you,

15:37.789 --> 15:39.029
I'll cover for you.

15:39.389 --> 15:40.749
We'll say you gave it to me,

15:41.749 --> 15:42.869
I pawned it,

15:42.990 --> 15:43.990
and he bought it from the pawnshop.

15:44.470 --> 15:45.869
Whatever he brings out,

15:47.070 --> 15:49.190
we'll say it came from me.

15:58.230 --> 15:58.830
Who?

15:58.950 --> 15:59.749
Who's there?

16:00.389 --> 16:01.029
It's me.

16:08.110 --> 16:09.669
Father has retired for the night.

16:09.950 --> 16:11.389
If you need to speak with him,

16:11.710 --> 16:12.789
please come back tomorrow.

16:16.310 --> 16:17.389
I came to see you.

16:22.669 --> 16:23.830
I came to ask

16:24.430 --> 16:25.310
how you feel about me.

16:27.509 --> 16:28.710
What do you mean?

16:29.909 --> 16:30.950
I don't understand.

16:31.310 --> 16:32.190
If you truly didn't,

16:32.789 --> 16:34.549
you wouldn't have told me
your given name.

16:36.310 --> 16:38.110
What difference does it make?

16:39.110 --> 16:40.749
The Ninth Young Lady
is my dearest friend.

16:44.470 --> 16:46.230
I can't stand in the way
of her marriage.

16:49.470 --> 16:52.509
Have they found that maid Moxiang yet?

16:52.509 --> 16:53.590
Not yet.

16:53.789 --> 16:54.590
But

16:54.590 --> 16:56.830
the Fifth Madam
has everyone searching nonstop.

16:57.029 --> 16:58.389
Moxiang is our witness.

16:59.110 --> 17:00.110
As long as she's alive,

17:00.110 --> 17:01.749
we can still turn this around.

17:02.470 --> 17:03.350
Alive?

17:03.909 --> 17:04.670
Alive?

17:12.589 --> 17:13.309
Moxiang.

17:15.109 --> 17:17.029
It's over. My Tingyun...

17:17.230 --> 17:20.390
- Madam!
- Madam!

17:20.749 --> 17:21.950
What happened yesterday

17:22.789 --> 17:25.269
was nothing but your brother's word.

17:26.349 --> 17:28.670
For the sake of our family ties,

17:28.829 --> 17:30.870
I'll overlook the lies you've spread.

17:31.670 --> 17:33.950
I'll release your sister now

17:34.190 --> 17:35.829
and give you enough money

17:36.069 --> 17:38.349
to sit the examination
in Yongning Prefecture.

17:40.470 --> 17:42.589
But if you insist on pursuing this,

17:42.589 --> 17:43.829
we'll take it to the authorities.

17:45.870 --> 17:47.549
Just don't forget,

17:47.829 --> 17:50.509
there's still a body in that well.

17:52.509 --> 17:53.749
Then call the authorities.

17:54.349 --> 17:56.950
The past few days in the ancestral hall
taught me something.

17:57.549 --> 17:59.069
I'm nothing but a broken roof tile,

17:59.069 --> 18:00.749
already smashed to pieces on the ground.

18:01.190 --> 18:03.029
The question is whether you're willing
to risk

18:03.029 --> 18:05.470
your precious white-jade porcelain vase
with me.

18:06.710 --> 18:08.470
You may not care about making me

18:08.470 --> 18:09.829
your fourth chastity memorial arch,

18:10.390 --> 18:12.390
but those three arches at the gate...

18:16.789 --> 18:18.269
are you willing to lose those too?

18:18.549 --> 18:20.630
Those arches are the foundation
of the Fu family's standing.

18:20.630 --> 18:23.309
Do you really want to drag
the entire Fu family down with you?

18:28.990 --> 18:30.349
Old Madam, I beg your favor.

18:31.150 --> 18:32.269
Please allow me to marry

18:32.390 --> 18:33.269
the Ninth Young Lady.

18:34.829 --> 18:36.230
You claim there was something
between us.

18:36.670 --> 18:37.710
Then spell it out.

18:38.349 --> 18:39.910
What day did we pledge ourselves
to each other?

18:40.589 --> 18:41.749
When and where

18:41.749 --> 18:42.749
did I give you

18:43.789 --> 18:44.630
that token?

18:44.630 --> 18:45.990
The night of the poetry gathering.

18:46.829 --> 18:47.589
That night,

18:47.990 --> 18:49.670
I came to visit my sister.

18:50.870 --> 18:52.549
You and I met in the back courtyard.

18:53.990 --> 18:54.789
You told me

18:55.549 --> 18:57.029
you had no feelings for Mr. Yu

18:57.269 --> 18:58.309
and didn't want to marry him.

18:58.829 --> 19:00.349
You said I was the man you wanted.

19:01.470 --> 19:03.109
So funny.

19:07.710 --> 19:08.509
Grandmother,

19:09.069 --> 19:10.910
that night, I went alone to see Yake.

19:11.029 --> 19:12.069
I passed the ancestral hall,

19:12.789 --> 19:14.870
which is how she knew I was alone

19:15.069 --> 19:16.349
and could use it to frame me.

19:17.269 --> 19:18.789
Madam Zuo may deny it,

19:19.230 --> 19:19.950
but Grandmother,

19:20.069 --> 19:20.910
Miss Fan

19:21.029 --> 19:22.109
can testify for me.

19:22.349 --> 19:23.589
Bring Miss Fan in.

19:30.150 --> 19:31.470
Please hurry, Miss Fan.

19:43.829 --> 19:44.990
Miss Fan,

19:45.390 --> 19:47.029
on the night of the poetry gathering,

19:47.549 --> 19:49.150
did you see the Ninth Young Lady?

19:50.230 --> 19:51.430
Yes. She came to see me.

19:51.789 --> 19:53.430
You two have always been close.

19:53.430 --> 19:55.269
It's no surprise
you'd cover for each other.

19:55.549 --> 19:56.549
Then tell me this.

19:56.910 --> 19:58.630
What did you talk about that night?

20:02.509 --> 20:03.829
That night,

20:04.549 --> 20:05.749
Tingyun and I

20:06.230 --> 20:06.990
talked about...

20:11.509 --> 20:12.390
Grandmother,

20:13.230 --> 20:16.390
of course Miss Fan will say
whatever Tingyun wants her to.

20:16.470 --> 20:18.069
But she can't give any details.

20:18.269 --> 20:19.190
Clearly,

20:19.430 --> 20:20.950
her testimony can't be trusted.

20:22.390 --> 20:23.390
All right, girls.

20:23.589 --> 20:26.029
Each of you take a blank sheet of paper

20:26.749 --> 20:29.069
and write down your private conversation

20:29.069 --> 20:30.150
from that night.

20:30.430 --> 20:31.789
If your accounts match,

20:31.789 --> 20:32.870
that will be proof enough.

20:34.109 --> 20:34.710
All right.

20:40.589 --> 20:41.549
Miss Fan,

20:42.670 --> 20:44.230
Tingyun's entire future

20:44.390 --> 20:45.990
is in your hands now.

20:46.269 --> 20:47.789
Write only the truth.

20:48.069 --> 20:49.150
Every detail must be exact.

21:00.910 --> 21:01.749
I came here today

21:03.509 --> 21:04.710
to tell you this.

21:07.190 --> 21:09.230
I'm willing to defy my mother for you.

21:10.589 --> 21:11.749
Are you willing

21:12.749 --> 21:14.710
to choose me over your friendship
with her?

21:33.990 --> 21:35.589
I'm not worth turning
against your mother for.

21:37.309 --> 21:38.029
Yake.

21:41.470 --> 21:42.630
That's all I needed to hear.

21:44.990 --> 21:46.349
I'll take that as a yes.

21:48.670 --> 21:49.430
Don't worry.

21:49.990 --> 21:51.109
That marriage between her and me

21:52.630 --> 21:53.990
will never happen.

22:02.470 --> 22:03.349
Miss Fan,

22:04.789 --> 22:07.230
the Ninth Young Lady
doesn't love Mr. Yu.

22:08.150 --> 22:10.710
If you come between us now,

22:11.910 --> 22:13.710
the Fu family will force her

22:13.870 --> 22:15.109
to marry Mr. Yu.

22:43.309 --> 22:45.950
Miss Fan, I'll ask you one last time.

22:46.150 --> 22:47.910
On the night of the poetry gathering,

22:48.710 --> 22:50.789
did Tingyun come to see you?

22:58.029 --> 22:58.749
No.

22:59.749 --> 23:00.470
No.

23:04.029 --> 23:05.029
That's a lie!

23:05.430 --> 23:06.150
Miss Fan,

23:06.269 --> 23:07.430
the Ninth Young Lady's future
is at stake.

23:07.430 --> 23:08.749
How could you lie?

23:08.749 --> 23:09.789
Insolent!

23:11.109 --> 23:12.749
Tell the truth!

23:15.950 --> 23:17.670
You're only a maid.

23:17.990 --> 23:20.230
Since when is this any concern of yours?

23:21.990 --> 23:22.870
Take her away.

23:24.269 --> 23:24.950
Old Madam.

23:25.109 --> 23:26.190
She didn't do it.

23:26.710 --> 23:27.549
Old Madam!

23:27.670 --> 23:29.069
She didn't do it!

23:29.430 --> 23:30.509
My Lady!

23:30.950 --> 23:32.870
My Lady!

23:33.870 --> 23:34.910
My Lady!

23:36.190 --> 23:36.910
Old Madam.

23:37.309 --> 23:38.789
I don't know what ties Tingyun has

23:38.789 --> 23:39.589
with Mr. Zuo,

23:40.269 --> 23:41.470
but she wasn't with me

23:41.990 --> 23:43.589
that night.

24:19.870 --> 24:21.910
(I'm willing to defy my mother for you.)

24:22.269 --> 24:23.349
(Are you willing)

24:23.789 --> 24:25.670
(to choose me over your friendship
with her?)

24:40.670 --> 24:41.269
See?

24:42.150 --> 24:44.950
So much for your dearest friend.

24:56.150 --> 24:56.829
Grandmother,

24:57.150 --> 24:58.990
if we want to put an end
to this scandal,

24:59.749 --> 25:00.990
there's only one way.

25:02.309 --> 25:03.430
I don't want anything else.

25:05.069 --> 25:06.269
I only want her.

25:06.910 --> 25:07.630
Tingzhuo.

25:08.950 --> 25:10.390
If you lay a hand on him again,

25:11.269 --> 25:12.990
I'll hang myself outside your gate.

25:18.630 --> 25:19.390
Mother,

25:20.190 --> 25:21.630
how can you not believe

25:21.950 --> 25:24.069
the girl you raised yourself?

25:24.549 --> 25:25.269
Mother...

25:26.470 --> 25:29.190
(Tingyun would never do anything
this foolish.)

25:29.549 --> 25:31.749
(But we've been backed into a corner.)

25:32.150 --> 25:33.990
(And if we agree to this marriage,)

25:34.150 --> 25:37.230
(the Fu family will be stuck
with those parasites for good.)

25:40.749 --> 25:42.269
Tingyun has fallen ill.

25:44.080 --> 25:46.160
♪Once a bird in a cage,
longing for the boundless sky♪

25:46.190 --> 25:48.069
Send her to Biyun Nunnery.

25:49.789 --> 25:51.349
She'll remain there in seclusion.

25:51.360 --> 25:56.040
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

25:56.549 --> 25:57.509
Grandmother.

25:57.710 --> 25:58.589
Let's go.

25:59.460 --> 26:02.760
♪Wash away the stain
of every false accusation♪

26:03.950 --> 26:04.870
Tingyun.

26:05.990 --> 26:06.950
Mother.

26:09.309 --> 26:10.390
Grandmother.

26:10.400 --> 26:14.920
♪Let this humble name carry me
through a life adrift♪

26:15.800 --> 26:21.320
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

26:22.200 --> 26:24.320
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

26:24.349 --> 26:25.630
Grandmother!

26:27.549 --> 26:29.109
Grandmother!

26:30.040 --> 26:33.400
♪I seek nothing beyond myself♪

26:34.950 --> 26:37.789
(Chastity Honored Through the Ages)
What good is protecting just one arch?

26:38.670 --> 26:40.269
I'll protect all four.

26:41.309 --> 26:42.269
As long as I stand,

26:42.870 --> 26:44.109
those arches stand with me.

26:45.150 --> 26:46.589
If I fall,

26:47.789 --> 26:50.109
the memorial arches
outside the Fu Residence

26:52.630 --> 26:54.670
will come crashing down with me.

26:55.269 --> 26:57.589
And the Fu men's political careers

26:57.789 --> 26:59.029
will be over too.

27:01.080 --> 27:05.680
(Virtuous and Chaste,
an Honor to Her House)

27:06.390 --> 27:07.069
No.

27:08.430 --> 27:10.029
I have to tell them the truth.

27:13.269 --> 27:14.349
What exactly will you tell them?

27:15.710 --> 27:17.190
Even if you won't think of yourself,

27:17.710 --> 27:19.029
think of Mr. Yu.

27:32.390 --> 27:33.630
Mr. Yu.

27:34.269 --> 27:35.029
That's right.

27:35.749 --> 27:37.589
Everyone has to look out for themselves.

27:38.029 --> 27:40.230
The Ninth Young Lady doesn't have to
have everything go her way.

27:41.029 --> 27:42.589
Even if she marries Zuo Junjie,

27:42.710 --> 27:44.470
she'll still be a daughter
of the Fu family.

27:44.990 --> 27:46.430
She'll still have money.

27:46.829 --> 27:47.870
But you, Miss Fan...

27:50.069 --> 27:51.549
It's finally your turn
to find happiness.

27:52.509 --> 27:53.109
You're right.

27:54.910 --> 27:57.430
I can't betray
Mr. Yu's feelings for me.

27:59.950 --> 28:01.309
I'm doing all this for him.

28:04.549 --> 28:05.829
He's all I have.

28:09.760 --> 28:14.600
(Biyun Nunnery, Fu Family Temple)

28:24.349 --> 28:25.309
Ninth Young Lady.

28:25.390 --> 28:26.269
Time to eat.

28:27.150 --> 28:28.390
What is this supposed to be?

28:28.549 --> 28:29.549
The smell alone makes us sick.

28:30.190 --> 28:31.829
Leftovers from a few days ago.

28:31.910 --> 28:33.630
How dare you treat her like this?

28:34.069 --> 28:35.630
I'll report this to Old Madam,

28:35.789 --> 28:36.870
and you'll answer for it.

28:37.990 --> 28:39.829
After a scandal like hers,

28:39.829 --> 28:41.190
she still thinks she can be picky?

28:41.309 --> 28:42.950
Whether she'll still be a noble lady

28:42.950 --> 28:44.029
remains to be seen.

28:44.269 --> 28:45.710
That's not for you to decide.

28:45.710 --> 28:47.029
Are you eating or not?

28:50.190 --> 28:50.870
No.

28:51.309 --> 28:52.910
Then starve!

28:59.230 --> 29:00.190
Tear down the arches!

29:00.190 --> 29:01.190
The Fu family doesn't deserve them!

29:01.190 --> 29:02.150
Tear them down!

29:02.749 --> 29:05.430
The scandal is all over town now.

29:08.309 --> 29:09.670
The townspeople are demanding

29:10.069 --> 29:12.029
that our chastity memorial arches
be torn down.

29:15.470 --> 29:16.710
As for Ninth Young Lady's disgrace,

29:17.029 --> 29:19.069
a decision must be made at once.

29:23.390 --> 29:24.470
Madam Yu.

29:25.789 --> 29:28.029
This is the flower

29:28.029 --> 29:29.910
Tingyun brought over, isn't it?

29:30.549 --> 29:32.789
It was in full bloom then.

29:34.430 --> 29:36.349
Now every blossom has withered.

29:41.309 --> 29:42.269
I had hoped

29:42.390 --> 29:43.749
to take it back to Yongning Prefecture

29:44.269 --> 29:45.470
and tend it carefully.

29:46.630 --> 29:47.990
But now...

29:50.910 --> 29:52.430
it's been blemished.

29:53.509 --> 29:55.670
The fault lies with the soil
in our house.

29:55.870 --> 29:57.069
We failed to let it flourish.

29:58.870 --> 30:00.470
But one blemish doesn't diminish
its beauty.

30:00.910 --> 30:03.029
If you still have a fondness for it,

30:03.549 --> 30:05.589
take it back to Yongning Prefecture.

30:05.789 --> 30:08.150
In time, it will grow strong and lush

30:08.230 --> 30:10.509
and repay your care with a profusion
of blossoms.

30:14.029 --> 30:15.349
After all,

30:15.349 --> 30:17.749
I've tended it with great care for
all these years.

30:18.230 --> 30:19.829
And what caught your eye

30:19.910 --> 30:22.109
was Tingyun herself, after all.

30:25.680 --> 30:27.920
(Eight-Character Slip)

30:31.560 --> 30:34.520
(Eight-Character Slip)

30:42.920 --> 30:45.680
(Eight-Character Slip)

31:06.509 --> 31:07.589
(Eight-Character Slip)
What

31:08.549 --> 31:10.069
becomes of this girl

31:11.150 --> 31:13.150
is entirely up to you, Madam.

31:22.349 --> 31:23.589
Well...

31:25.829 --> 31:27.749
I need to think about it.

31:56.549 --> 31:57.109
Mother.

31:58.109 --> 31:59.430
You're here about the Fu family?

32:00.109 --> 32:01.109
I'm afraid the Ninth Young Lady

32:01.430 --> 32:02.470
is no longer an option.

32:04.190 --> 32:05.190
May I

32:06.269 --> 32:07.349
suggest someone else?

32:08.109 --> 32:09.390
Master Fan has a daughter.

32:10.349 --> 32:11.349
She's virtuous and accomplished,

32:11.349 --> 32:12.430
with a gentle disposition.

32:13.910 --> 32:14.630
Since

32:14.829 --> 32:16.190
word has already gone out

32:16.190 --> 32:18.390
that you're looking for a wife for me,

32:19.589 --> 32:21.230
why not simply choose her?

32:26.269 --> 32:28.269
Marry a girl from such a modest family?

32:30.150 --> 32:31.470
No matter how talented she is,

32:32.190 --> 32:33.430
she has no family standing.

32:34.630 --> 32:36.950
Wouldn't that invite even more gossip?

32:37.470 --> 32:38.069
Mother,

32:38.749 --> 32:39.990
if you let me marry her,

32:40.349 --> 32:42.390
I'll top all three imperial exams,

32:44.190 --> 32:45.509
just as you've always wanted.

32:47.870 --> 32:48.630
Fine.

32:49.269 --> 32:50.230
You may go.

32:53.870 --> 32:54.630
Madam,

32:55.230 --> 32:56.430
are you really

32:56.990 --> 32:58.789
going to give Young Master
what he wants?

33:00.990 --> 33:03.109
You think he truly loves Miss Fan?

33:04.109 --> 33:05.910
What he wants is a potted plant,

33:06.549 --> 33:07.829
someone who will support him,

33:07.829 --> 33:09.190
and do as he says.

33:10.150 --> 33:10.990
Very well.

33:11.829 --> 33:12.910
I'll give him exactly that.

33:13.390 --> 33:14.589
One day,

33:14.710 --> 33:17.509
Young Master will understand
that you wanted what was best for him.

33:19.589 --> 33:20.870
I don't need him to understand.

33:22.150 --> 33:23.309
From now on,

33:23.670 --> 33:24.789
I get to be the loving mother,

33:25.589 --> 33:27.749
and he gets the wife he wants.

33:28.230 --> 33:29.829
Everyone wins.

33:30.430 --> 33:30.990
Then...

33:31.470 --> 33:32.630
what about the Ninth Young Lady?

33:33.950 --> 33:35.190
We each have our own fate.

33:37.069 --> 33:38.269
This scandal

33:39.269 --> 33:41.309
is already the talk of the town.

33:43.710 --> 33:45.470
We'd best keep our distance for now.

33:50.460 --> 33:52.760
(Fu Residence)

33:54.029 --> 33:54.789
Mother,

33:55.349 --> 33:57.789
my daughter-in-law and I
have come with good news.

33:58.430 --> 34:00.390
The Yu family has formally proposed

34:00.710 --> 34:02.749
marriage to Fan Kun's daughter.

34:03.509 --> 34:04.349
Why not

34:04.749 --> 34:06.269
make the most of the happy occasion

34:06.829 --> 34:09.149
and arrange my brother's marriage
to Tingyun

34:09.149 --> 34:10.470
at the same time?

34:11.229 --> 34:13.350
While preparing the betrothal gifts,

34:13.350 --> 34:14.990
I noticed the list

34:15.069 --> 34:16.509
calls for a dressing table.

34:16.830 --> 34:18.189
Grandmother, as you know,

34:18.549 --> 34:20.709
my family doesn't have one.

34:21.109 --> 34:22.229
But I remember

34:22.430 --> 34:23.790
there happens to be one

34:24.229 --> 34:25.870
in your storeroom.

34:40.549 --> 34:41.790
Once they're married,

34:42.029 --> 34:44.109
our families will be closer than ever.

34:44.589 --> 34:46.750
So don't keep it all to yourself.

34:46.750 --> 34:47.709
In a couple of days,

34:47.709 --> 34:49.470
have someone send it over.

34:50.669 --> 34:51.950
Don't push your luck.

34:53.589 --> 34:54.669
Mother, you must be busy.

34:54.950 --> 34:56.709
We'll leave you to it.

35:03.509 --> 35:05.990
The Yu family outranks ours.

35:06.589 --> 35:07.830
Losing to them

35:08.509 --> 35:09.470
is no disgrace.

35:10.149 --> 35:12.229
But that lowly Zuo woman?

35:12.790 --> 35:14.229
I thought enough of her

35:14.830 --> 35:16.189
to pay to bring her into this family

35:16.589 --> 35:19.149
and preserve our family's legacy
of chastity.

35:19.629 --> 35:20.629
Now she thinks

35:20.629 --> 35:23.430
she's figured out how the game
is played.

35:24.029 --> 35:25.950
She thinks she's found my weakness

35:25.950 --> 35:29.029
and can walk all over me.

35:31.669 --> 35:32.549
Old Madam,

35:34.669 --> 35:35.910
the Ninth Young Lady's scandal

35:36.509 --> 35:38.069
is all over town.

35:38.629 --> 35:40.069
If she doesn't marry
into the Zuo family,

35:40.870 --> 35:42.509
the only path left is death.

35:43.470 --> 35:44.229
Now,

35:44.830 --> 35:46.229
on one side are the arches,

35:46.910 --> 35:48.790
and on the other
is the Ninth Young Lady's life.

35:49.709 --> 35:51.229
Once you've made your choice,

35:51.229 --> 35:52.750
I'll see that it's done.

36:00.069 --> 36:01.310
The Yu family really

36:01.709 --> 36:03.109
got engaged to Yake?

36:08.549 --> 36:10.470
If the charge of adultery sticks to me,

36:11.310 --> 36:13.270
the three chastity memorial arches
standing before the Fu Residence

36:13.270 --> 36:14.109
will all crumble.

36:14.950 --> 36:15.830
My Lady,

36:16.109 --> 36:18.790
Old Madam
will let us leave safely, right?

36:19.589 --> 36:21.350
The future of the entire Fu family
is at stake.

36:21.790 --> 36:23.470
Grandmother won't find this choice easy.

36:23.910 --> 36:26.189
The Fifth Madam will plead
with Old Madam for us, won't she?

36:26.709 --> 36:27.950
And there's Seventh Young Master.

36:29.350 --> 36:30.310
It's been days,

36:30.310 --> 36:31.509
and we've heard nothing.

36:32.910 --> 36:34.750
I'm afraid Mother and Tingzhuo

36:35.950 --> 36:37.830
are being kept
under Grandmother's watch.

36:38.589 --> 36:39.549
Now

36:40.950 --> 36:42.830
I need someone outside all of this.

36:43.830 --> 36:45.509
Maybe he can save me.

36:47.629 --> 36:49.149
I'd like some pickles,

36:50.270 --> 36:51.950
cured with Ground Snow.

36:52.669 --> 36:54.549
The salt shops in town should carry it.

36:55.790 --> 36:56.310
But,

36:56.310 --> 36:56.669
well...

36:57.270 --> 36:59.629
what does Ground Snow look like?

36:59.790 --> 37:01.390
There are a few grains left in here.

37:01.790 --> 37:02.830
Just buy the same kind.

37:04.390 --> 37:06.390
Two old women came in
with this cloth pouch.

37:06.629 --> 37:08.069
They specifically asked for Ground Snow.

37:08.189 --> 37:09.229
One of our men at the salt shop

37:09.229 --> 37:10.629
recognized it as something
belonging to Mr. Zhao,

37:10.870 --> 37:12.029
so he brought it straight to us.

37:14.310 --> 37:15.629
Who were those two women?

37:15.990 --> 37:17.950
They said they were from Biyun Nunnery.

37:18.549 --> 37:19.870
If I remember correctly,

37:19.950 --> 37:20.910
Biyun Nunnery

37:20.990 --> 37:22.229
is the Fu family's temple.

37:23.990 --> 37:24.790
The Fu family?

37:29.189 --> 37:30.189
(Loyalty and Filial Piety Endure)
Old Madam.

37:31.069 --> 37:32.790
Everything is ready.

37:50.310 --> 37:52.149
What's she doing at Biyun Nunnery?

37:53.189 --> 37:54.430
We can snatch her out and ransom her.

37:54.430 --> 37:54.870
Yes.

37:55.149 --> 37:56.270
Let's do that!

38:04.270 --> 38:05.950
(If the Ninth Young Lady dies,)

38:06.229 --> 38:07.910
(ten or twenty years from now,)

38:08.109 --> 38:10.350
(the Fu family will have other ladies.)

38:10.509 --> 38:11.910
(But if she lives,)

38:12.029 --> 38:15.430
(there may be no Fu family left in ten
or twenty years.)

38:15.910 --> 38:17.069
What are you doing?

38:17.950 --> 38:19.229
Ninth Young Lady,

38:19.990 --> 38:21.629
which

38:21.790 --> 38:23.229
would you rather do first,

38:23.509 --> 38:25.509
take your medicine

38:25.589 --> 38:26.830
or get dressed?

38:27.109 --> 38:28.470
Your choice.

38:30.669 --> 38:31.669
What do you mean?

38:34.750 --> 38:36.509
Grandmother ordered this?

38:37.229 --> 38:38.430
What are you here to do?

38:38.549 --> 38:40.029
To preserve a good name,

38:40.229 --> 38:41.069
we have to say

38:41.069 --> 38:43.270
your betrothal
to the Zuo family was already settled.

38:43.549 --> 38:45.390
Then there was never any illicit affair.

38:46.109 --> 38:47.390
But if you actually marry
into that family,

38:47.549 --> 38:49.629
the Zuo family will stir up trouble,

38:49.629 --> 38:51.069
and we will never know peace.

38:51.350 --> 38:52.790
Stop struggling.

38:52.950 --> 38:54.950
Consider it one last act of filial duty
to Old Madam.

38:54.950 --> 38:56.270
Once you've finished this bowl,

38:56.470 --> 38:57.990
we'll put you in the bridal sedan.

38:58.470 --> 38:59.629
Then Zuo Junjie

38:59.870 --> 39:01.629
won't get anything out of you either.

39:01.830 --> 39:03.229
He can be a widower instead.

39:03.509 --> 39:04.390
The family

39:04.629 --> 39:06.350
will make offerings at your grave.

39:06.750 --> 39:07.750
Let go!

39:07.750 --> 39:08.709
Yuwei!

39:11.430 --> 39:12.589
I won't drink it!

39:13.669 --> 39:15.830
Old Madam really does know you best.

39:16.270 --> 39:18.430
The two of us
have never served you before.

39:19.069 --> 39:20.310
Perhaps we're not close enough.

39:21.229 --> 39:22.430
Bring in someone else,

39:22.430 --> 39:23.910
and maybe you'll drink it.

39:35.240 --> 39:37.560
(Next Episode)

39:38.509 --> 39:39.149
Miss Fan.

39:39.589 --> 39:40.790
The Ninth Young Lady of the Fu family

39:41.310 --> 39:42.109
has died of illness.

39:42.350 --> 39:43.189
She's dead?

39:44.350 --> 39:45.709
How could she be dead?

39:47.109 --> 39:48.509
The body identification record?

39:49.149 --> 39:50.990
This is the woman you wanted
as your sister-in-law.

39:51.669 --> 39:54.270
Farewell, Ninth Young Lady.

39:55.629 --> 39:56.549
Madam.

39:56.549 --> 39:58.069
A wedding procession ahead

39:58.069 --> 39:59.229
is blocking the road.

39:59.430 --> 40:02.229
A wedding always gives way to a funeral.

40:02.709 --> 40:03.950
Tell them to move aside.

40:19.280 --> 40:23.600
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

40:27.200 --> 40:31.560
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

40:33.680 --> 40:38.320
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

40:38.560 --> 40:41.360
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

40:42.520 --> 40:47.160
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

40:50.360 --> 40:57.200
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

40:58.080 --> 41:04.600
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:05.560 --> 41:09.000
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:09.520 --> 41:13.720
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:14.000 --> 41:19.680
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

41:31.800 --> 41:35.680
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

41:39.600 --> 41:43.600
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

41:45.320 --> 41:50.000
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

41:50.320 --> 41:53.000
♪Kept close within my heart♪

41:54.080 --> 41:58.920
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

42:02.440 --> 42:09.360
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:10.240 --> 42:16.720
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

42:17.600 --> 42:21.120
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:21.560 --> 42:25.920
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:26.120 --> 42:31.840
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
